{"id":"huntik:page:17649","page_id":17649,"title":"Unnamed Suit 020","kind":"character","namespace":0,"summary":"Unnamed Suit 020 is a Suit within the Organization. He operates from Sutos Island, Aegean Sea, under Grier.","profile":{"image":{"text":"File:Unnamed Suit 020.png","wikitext":"File:Unnamed Suit 020.png","links":[]},"aliases":{"text":"","wikitext":"","links":[]},"relations":{"text":"","wikitext":"","links":[]},"base":{"text":"Sutos Island","wikitext":"[[Sutos Island]]","links":[{"target_title":"Sutos Island","label":"Sutos Island","target_id":"huntik:page:3920","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Sutos_Island","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3920"}]},"group":{"text":"The Organization\nSuits","wikitext":"[[The Organization]] {{Icon|ORG}}<br> [[Suits]]","links":[{"target_title":"The Organization","label":"The Organization","target_id":"huntik:page:1990","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Organization","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"},{"target_title":"Suits","label":"Suits","target_id":"huntik:page:2050","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suits","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"}]},"first":{"text":"\"The Beautiful Trap\"","wikitext":"\"[[The Beautiful Trap]]\"","links":[{"target_title":"The Beautiful Trap","label":"The Beautiful Trap","target_id":"huntik:page:3371","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Beautiful_Trap","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3371"}]},"last":{"text":"","wikitext":"","links":[]},"gender":{"text":"Male","wikitext":"Male","links":[]},"hair":{"text":"Blonde","wikitext":"Blonde","links":[]},"eyes":{"text":"Brown","wikitext":"Brown","links":[]},"va":{"text":"","wikitext":"","links":[]}},"infoboxes":[{"name":"infobox character","parameters":[{"name":"image","value_wikitext":"File:Unnamed Suit 020.png","value_text":"File:Unnamed Suit 020.png","links":[]},{"name":"aliases","value_wikitext":"","value_text":"","links":[]},{"name":"relations","value_wikitext":"","value_text":"","links":[]},{"name":"base","value_wikitext":"[[Sutos Island]]","value_text":"Sutos Island","links":[{"target_title":"Sutos Island","label":"Sutos Island","target_id":"huntik:page:3920","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Sutos_Island","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3920"}]},{"name":"group","value_wikitext":"[[The Organization]] {{Icon|ORG}}<br> [[Suits]]","value_text":"The Organization\nSuits","links":[{"target_title":"The Organization","label":"The Organization","target_id":"huntik:page:1990","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Organization","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"},{"target_title":"Suits","label":"Suits","target_id":"huntik:page:2050","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suits","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"}]},{"name":"first","value_wikitext":"\"[[The Beautiful Trap]]\"","value_text":"\"The Beautiful Trap\"","links":[{"target_title":"The Beautiful Trap","label":"The Beautiful Trap","target_id":"huntik:page:3371","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Beautiful_Trap","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3371"}]},{"name":"last","value_wikitext":"","value_text":"","links":[]},{"name":"gender","value_wikitext":"Male","value_text":"Male","links":[]},{"name":"hair","value_wikitext":"Blonde","value_text":"Blonde","links":[]},{"name":"eyes","value_wikitext":"Brown","value_text":"Brown","links":[]},{"name":"va","value_wikitext":"","value_text":"","links":[]}],"start":0,"end":314}],"sections":[{"heading":"History","level":2,"wikitext":"This Suit was recruited by [[Grier]] after [[DeFoe]]'s removal from [[the Organization]]. {{Source|The Beautiful Trap}}\n\nHe accompanied Grier in claiming [[Sutos Island]] under the Organization. Under this team of Suits, the people of Sutos were registered, and peace from civil war was brought to the island. Unnamed Suit 020 and his team were led into a trap by [[Lok Lambert]] and [[Sophie Casterwill]]. This Suit invoked a [[Redcap]] Titan to fight the two, and the team nearly overwhelmed the Foundation members. The fight was cut short by [[Dante Vale]] and Grier, who had reached a truce.{{source|Like Father, Unlike Son}}","text":"This Suit was recruited by Grier after DeFoe's removal from the Organization. [The Beautiful Trap]\n\nHe accompanied Grier in claiming Sutos Island under the Organization. Under this team of Suits, the people of Sutos were registered, and peace from civil war was brought to the island. Unnamed Suit 020 and his team were led into a trap by Lok Lambert and Sophie Casterwill. This Suit invoked a Redcap Titan to fight the two, and the team nearly overwhelmed the Foundation members. The fight was cut short by Dante Vale and Grier, who had reached a truce.[Like Father, Unlike Son]"},{"heading":"Abilities","level":2,"wikitext":"Like most Suits, he was issued with the standard Organization [[Titans]].\n\n{{col-begin}}{{col-2}}","text":"Like most Suits, he was issued with the standard Organization Titans."},{"heading":"Spells Utilized","level":3,"wikitext":"* [[Raypulse]]\n\n{{col-2}}","text":"• Raypulse"},{"heading":"Bonded Titans","level":3,"wikitext":"* [[Jokoul]]\n\n{{col-end}}\n[[Category:Seekers]]\n[[Category:Organization members]]\n[[Category:Suits]]","text":"• Jokoul"}],"full_text":"Unnamed Suit 020 is a Suit within the Organization. He operates from Sutos Island, Aegean Sea, under Grier.\n\nHistory\n\nThis Suit was recruited by Grier after DeFoe's removal from the Organization. [The Beautiful Trap]\n\nHe accompanied Grier in claiming Sutos Island under the Organization. Under this team of Suits, the people of Sutos were registered, and peace from civil war was brought to the island. Unnamed Suit 020 and his team were led into a trap by Lok Lambert and Sophie Casterwill. This Suit invoked a Redcap Titan to fight the two, and the team nearly overwhelmed the Foundation members. The fight was cut short by Dante Vale and Grier, who had reached a truce.[Like Father, Unlike Son]\n\nAbilities\n\nLike most Suits, he was issued with the standard Organization Titans.\n\nSpells Utilized\n\n• Raypulse\n\nBonded Titans\n\n• Jokoul","raw_wikitext":"{{infobox character\n| image     = File:Unnamed Suit 020.png\n| aliases   = \n| relations = \n| base      = [[Sutos Island]]\n| group     = [[The Organization]] {{Icon|ORG}}<br> [[Suits]]\n| first     = \"[[The Beautiful Trap]]\"\n| last      = \n| gender    = Male\n| hair      = Blonde\n| eyes      = Brown\n| va        = \n}}\n'''Unnamed Suit 020''' is a [[Suit]] within [[the Organization]]. He operates from [[Sutos Island]], [[Aegean Sea]], under [[Grier]].\n\n== History ==\nThis Suit was recruited by [[Grier]] after [[DeFoe]]'s removal from [[the Organization]]. {{Source|The Beautiful Trap}}\n\nHe accompanied Grier in claiming [[Sutos Island]] under the Organization. Under this team of Suits, the people of Sutos were registered, and peace from civil war was brought to the island. Unnamed Suit 020 and his team were led into a trap by [[Lok Lambert]] and [[Sophie Casterwill]]. This Suit invoked a [[Redcap]] Titan to fight the two, and the team nearly overwhelmed the Foundation members. The fight was cut short by [[Dante Vale]] and Grier, who had reached a truce.{{source|Like Father, Unlike Son}}\n\n== Abilities ==\nLike most Suits, he was issued with the standard Organization [[Titans]].\n\n{{col-begin}}{{col-2}}\n=== Spells Utilized ===\n* [[Raypulse]]\n\n{{col-2}}\n=== Bonded Titans ===\n* [[Jokoul]]\n\n{{col-end}}\n[[Category:Seekers]]\n[[Category:Organization members]]\n[[Category:Suits]]","categories":["Characters","Organization members","Seekers","Suits"],"links":[{"target_id":"huntik:page:3920","status":"resolved","target_title":"Sutos Island","label":"Sutos Island","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Sutos_Island","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3920"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:1990","statu